            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Tell me about the guild."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I founded the woodcutting guild when I retired from the Shayzien military. I spotted the ancient redwood trees in the hills many years ago from the Shayzien camp, and decided to construct the guild around them."
              },
              {
                "npc": "You can find them to the West, just follow the path."
              },
              {
                "npc": "However, if you're skilled in combat, or simply afraid of heights, the ent cavern may be more suited for you. The ents dwell deep beneath the ancient redwoods, and can be accessed through the cave to the North-West."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Is there anything else I can help you with?"
